  "Back_Additional Features & Traits": "Fey Touched. You can cast this feat’s spells without a spell slot once per long rest. You can also cast these spells using spell slots you have of the appropriate level. Your spellcasting ability for these spells is Charisma. (Misty Step, Sleep)\r\rSuperior Darkvision.\rYou can see in dim light within\r120 feet of you as if it were bright light, and in darkness as if it were dim light.\r\rEldritch Invocations.\rEldritch Sight. You can cast detect magic at will, without expending a spell slot.\rPact of the Tome. Your patron gives you a grimoire called a Book of Shadows. If you lose it, you can perform a 1-hour ceremony to receive a replacement from your patron. This ceremony can be performed during a short or long rest, and it destroys the previous book. The book turns to ash when you die.\rDark One’s Blessing. When you reduce a hostile creature to 0 hit points, you gain 9 temporary hp.",
