  "Front_Feature 1": "Darkvision with a range of 120 feet.\rYou can spend 2 sorcery points to cast darkness spell. If you cast it this way, you can see through the darkness created by it.",
  "Front_Feature 10": "",
  "Front_Feature 2": "When damage reduces you to 0 hit points, make a Charisma saving throw (DC5 + damage taken). On a success, you drop to 1 hit point and cannot use this feature again until you finish a long rest.",
  "Front_Feature 3": "Feature for sorcerers that allows them to reroll a failed ability check by spending 2 sorcery points.",
  "Front_Feature 4": "Subtle Spell. When you cast a spell, you can spend 1 sorcery point to cast it without any somatic or verbal components.\rQuickened Spell. When you cast a spell that has a casting time of 1 action, you can spend 2 sorcery points to change the casting time to 1 bonus action for this casting.",
  "Front_Feature 5": "You gain the ability to call forth a howling creature of darkness to harass your foes. As a bonus action, you can spend 3 sorcery points to magically summon a hound of ill omen to target one creature you can see within 120ft of you. The hound is medium size and a monstrosity.",
